window.products.push({"id":200045,"name":"Duwenem Bath Tub and Shower Mat - Extra Long 38 x 14 Inch Non-Slip Bathtub Mats with Drain Holes and Suction Cups, Machine Washable TPE Bath Mat for B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gy750kx4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHY CHOOSE US: 1. TPE Bath Mat: Our bathroom mats are made of high quality TPE (Thermoplastic rubber), Free of BPA, PAHS, PAES, POFA, etc. Which has better environmental protection, resilience, slip resistance and feel than PVC plastic bathroom mats. 2. Easy to Clean: Machine washable mat bath. Simply throw the mat in your washing machine on cold with gentle detergent and air dry. 3. Perfect Design: 14 x 38 inches, fits any size bathtub or shower. More than 100 powerful suction cups ensure a firm and secure, hundreds of large-aperture drainage holes do not have to worry about water accumulation. 4. Comfort Massage Mat: The bathtub mat with round hole and texture can also be a fashion and convenient massage shower mat for kids, adult and elderly. 5. Versatile Bath Tub Mat: Our floor mat is versatile for home bathroom and it’s a perfect addition for hotels, gyms, saunas, spas, and anywhere else you need a premium baby bath mat. Not only the bath mat can be placed inside the bathtub but also outside the tub. In addition, it can also be used under the sink, in the kitchen. RECOMMENDED MEASURES: 1. It is recommended soaking the mat in a tub by warm water for 10 minutes prior to your first use to make the bath mat unfold. 2. Before using, moisten the tub with a little bit of water and aim at the center mat with suction cups on under side, applying moderate pressure to attach the suction cups onto the tub floor. 3. We recommend rinsing and drying your bathmat periodically. The bath mat should be hung up over the tub or somewhere else after use. IMPORTANT: 1. Our bath mats work on smooth, non-textured shower tub floors. Textured and tiled surfaces do not support proper suction to the surface. 2. Do not use bath oils and jump on the tub mat to avoid slipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gy750kx4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Duwenem","source_asin":"B097P31FJZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200045","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097P31FJZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097P31FJZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":200046,"name":"Maison d' Hermine Table Runner 100% Cotton Premium 14.50 Inch x 72 Inch Decorative Runner Easter Table Runners for Dining, Kitchen, Parties & Camping,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-NE2wOqyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton SOFT & DURABLE: Premium Collections from Maison d’ Hermine are an exclusive range of sophisticated designs & the products that are crafted from 100% COMBED COTTON. Comparing with regular cotton, combed cotton is superior since the fibres undergo an extra step before they are made into yarn, resulting in a softer, stronger & more luxurious fabric. PACKAGE INCLUDES: 1 Table Runner measures 14.50\"x72\". Comes with a premium gift box packaging. Each product in the Maison d’ Hermine Premium Collection is a perfect gift for all occasions & all seasons especially Thanksgiving, Christmas, Spring, Summer, Easter, Wedding, Party & So on. UNIQUE DESIGNS: All the products are exclusively designed in Europe & rendered in watercolor, with traditional motifs captured with a painter’s eye for light, hue, and lovely detail. A wide range of captivating designs to pick from, each designs in the Maison d’ Hermine Premium Collection are uniquely hand drawn by skilful artists. The attractive motifs punctuated with vibrant colors offer a real glimpse into the beauty of European designs. QUALITY CRAFTSMANSHIP: Tailored with care, our premium products are ideal for both formal and casual settings. We follow a variety of seaming and sewing techniques to make sure that the seams stay tacked and the corners are crisp and well mitered. The extra attention we pay to the sewing process results in corners that are caught securely with no loosely hanging threads, making our products a great choice for all occasions. EASY CARE & MAINTENANCE: Machine wash warm with like colors, do not bleach, tumble dry low and warm iron if needed. More coordinated Kitchen Linen and Table Linen products are available in our Premium Collections.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-NE2wOqyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maison d' Hermine","source_asin":"B0BH8Y4YNV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200046","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BH8Y4YNV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BH8Y4YNV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
