window.products.push({"id":200089,"name":"6.5' Ficus Tree - Fake Tree - Large Faux Plants Indoor - Tall Artificial Plants with Realistic Silk Leaves for Indoor Home Decor or Office - Handmade ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":148.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GbsCMPnSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Inspired by the native ficus trees in the Mediterranean, this artificial ficus tree with it's real wood trunks and moss base is the ideal way to bring the lush beauty of nature into your home or office decor. Trusted by hundreds of thousands of homes and offices across the United States, our thoughtfully designed fake tree is perfect for indoor use with a variety of styles. With over 1,000 realistic and nearly natural leaves this tall artificial Ficus tree connects your decor with nature. Hand Crafted for unique beauty, durability and stability. We use our collective experience of over a century to build the highest quality products and bring lifelike artificial trees and plants into your home decor that makes a statement. Please note as each tree is hand-built in the USA, there may be slight variation in tree shape. This is no ordinary fake tree! Improve your spatial wellness and make your space more welcoming and peaceful by adding a touch of nature with this artificial Ficus tree to farmhouse, modern, eclectic, boho, traditional, classic, Hollywood glam or even industrial décor styles. Use this along with one of Cypress & Alabaster's artificial fig trees or an artificial palm or even birdsnest faux trees to create a full and balanced feel. No hassle, natural beauty. Never again have a plant or real tree die while you're on vacation or be a burden to care for when life is busy! This artificial tree will bring you all the beauty and joy of the real thing without ever dying, becoming overgrown or requiring food. Who says an artificial tree can’t look just as good as the real thing? Long after other plants have wilted, this ficus tree will still be lush and gorgeous, but requires no water, trimming, shaping or food! Eternally Green & Easy to Adjust - Designed to stand incredibly strong and sturdy while maintaining a realistic lifelike look, forever. Outfitted with inner metal wires, you can easily bend and adjust the faux leaves into any desired shape, tall & slender or wide & bushy. Pick one of Cypress & Alabaster's eco-friendly fiberglass planters to elevate the look even more! This artificial Ficus tree pairs well with tall or short gray fiberglass planters. See the Cypress & Alabaster page for options!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GbsCMPnSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cypress & Alabaster","source_asin":"B0BGYS5G3T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGYS5G3T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGYS5G3T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
