window.products.push({"id":200217,"name":"Lunch Bag Tote Bag by QOGiR - Large Reusable Insulated Neoprene lunch Bag with Inside Pocket (Elephant)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kSskJVoYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BRAND STORY QOGIR is part of My Life Company Limited, the same name of the world’s second highest peak. It comes from Tibetan language, meaning “The White Goddess”,representing for nobility and beauty. As a innovator in bag and accessories, QOGIR is a portfolio of powerful fashionable, functional and lifestyle brands. FEATURES ◆Large of 10”Lx15”Hx7”W inch neoprene lunch bag, it’s great for women.◆4-6 hours insulation, no need to worry about the gourmet getting too cold(or warm).◆The unique pattern, you will be the only one, because you will not carry the same bag with others.◆Durable handle, easy to carry, super inside pockets,perfect for icepack, tableware or snacks.◆Machine washable, reusable and durable, easy to clean, greatly saving your time, effort and money.◆Stain-resistant, protecting you gourmet safe.◆Smooth zipper, you can easily open and close it.◆BPA-free, PVC-free and lead-free, keeping your food safety and fresh longer than the normal plastic or shoddy neoprene lunch bags. And more, it’s better to protect the environment. QUESTIONS AND ANSWERS ◆The smell? Don’t worry about it if you find there is a little smell in the lunch bag. The smell is from the neoprene material, it is non-toxic and no harmful. We suggest that you wash it and dry it in the sunlight for a few days to dispel it.◆ The zipper? Using the high-quality nylon zipper, it’s more smooth and safe than the plastic zipper. You can easily open and close it.◆ The size? Fits containers: 2 lunch boxes (8\"L x 3\" Hx 6.5\"W inch ) + 2 carton milk(1 liter per box)+2 apples + 2 sandwiches + some snacks◆ The insulation time? 4-6 hours, depending on the outside temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kSskJVoYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QOGIR","source_asin":"B07RGYXMSG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200217","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RGYXMSG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RGYXMSG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
