window.products.push({"id":200341,"name":"MICHLEY Unbreakable Cocktail Glasses 100% Tritan Plastic Martini Glasses 8.7oz, Dishwasher Safe, Ideal Gifts for Wedding Party, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z2fxxtsKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS: The cocktail glasses is made of 100% American made Premium material Tritan Plastic, which meets environmental protection requirements and FDA requirements. It is strong and not easy to break. The surface of the cocktail glasses is clear and transparent and looks like a real glass. ELEGANT WINE GLASSES: The wide mouth of the MICHLEY cocktail glass can better release the aroma of the wine, and the perfect glass height brings you a comfortable wine tasting experience. The surface of the exquisite martini glass has high light transmittance, and you can clearly see the wine in the glass. The sturdy base can be firmly placed on the tray, table and counter. You will not help but fall in love with this glass. SUITABLE FOR VARIOUS OCCASIONS: MICHLEY cocktail glasses is very suitable for parties, camping, weddings, anniversaries and other activities. It is not only an ideal choice for cocktails, martinis, red wine, but also suitable for juice, ice cream or anything else you want. It is lightweight, fully reusable and comfortable to hold. Add them to the wine cabinet and wish you happiness! CONVENIENT AND EASY TO WASH: The durable MICHLEY cocktail glasses is dishwasher safe on top rack, they can withstand repeated washing in dishwashers up to 200 F, MICHLEY cocktail glasses will stay clear and durable even after hundreds of dishwasher cycles, but please note put them vertically in dishwasher and do not squeeze reciprocally, at last wiping gently with a soft fabric after washing to keep them look better! Whether dishwasher or washing by hand, it’s convenient and easy to wash! EXTREMELY SHATTERPROOF & DURABLE: MICHLEY martini glasses will not broken like glass, we used the material is 100% unbreakable Tritan Plastic, it’s stronger and more durable than any other common plastic material, the stem are very sturdy, no more anxious of breaking the glassware, these are safe to use around the pool, great for the patio, desk, and boat, applicable for kids and adult, perfect for any outdoor and indoor environment, It’s a better alternative to glasses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z2fxxtsKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MICHLEY","source_asin":"B09681FBMK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200341","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09681FBMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09681FBMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
