window.products.push({"id":200406,"name":"30 Cuts Mandoline Slicer Food Chopper ALL IN ONE : Slicer, Chopper, Grater, Dicer, French Fry Cutter (Blue), 41*21*11 cm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51njvLv87sL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Diversified functional design, super convenient to use, can experience the happiness of one button switching, meet the needs of many aspects of life. Slicing, Cutting, Mashing, Grinding, Etc. MAIN FEATURES [Safer] The unique design prevents your hands from ever going near the built-in blades, making this tool the safest option for an expert slice. Dimensions：2.6 lbs, 15.4*5.5*6.1 inches. [Multifunctional] The blades allow flexibility to easily cut, slice, shred, chop fruits and vegetables in shapes and sizes. Such as a potato, you can make it into wavy or normal slices, strips or mash it easily. [Saving Time And Effort] Ultra- sharp stainless steel blade can help you shorten prep time comparing with traditional blades slicing. This tool is easy to chop or slice veggies and fruits. [Easy Clean] Compact design folds down for easy storage, while the included brush eliminates buildup on the blades and food catch container keeps countertops clean. [Wide Application] The multifunctional vegetable tool is designed to chop all kinds of food, such as onion, potato, mushroom, cucumber, carrot, tomato, ginger, garlic, cheese, etc. [High Quality] Mainly made of ABS material, does not contain BPA, non-toxic and tasteless, easy to clean. Does not produce harmful substances, you can rest assured to use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51njvLv87sL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09W5R1VK8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W5R1VK8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W5R1VK8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":200407,"name":"Miyabi Kaizen II 7-inch Santoku Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61abQluLF9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MIYABI moves one step closer to perfection with Kaizen II – Japanese for “improvement” or \"change for the better.\" The Kaizen II collection boasts traditional Japanese craftsmanship combined with the best hardening technology and beautiful modern design. The core, forged from resilient FC61 super steel, is protected by a stunning 48 layers of stainless steel. And Miyabi Kaizen II knives are as beautiful as they are functional. The blades’ gorgeous flower Damascus pattern is dramatically darkened through acid dipping. The double FRIODUR ice-hardened blade makes for improved corrosion resistance and astonishing durability. Artisans hand-hone the blades using the venerable four-step Honbazuke method. This fine attention to detail translates into a work of art that is the ultimate in precision cutting. The blade is balanced by a substantial D-shaped handle made of black pakkawood. Effortless to hold, the classic Japanese “D”-shape handle offers a comfortable grip for stress-free cutting. This striking handle truly matches the caliber of the blade. Handcrafted in Seki, Japan, a city renowned for its highest quality cutlery production.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61abQluLF9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIYABI","source_asin":"B084D7JZFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084D7JZFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084D7JZFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
