window.products.push({"id":200417,"name":"TreeLen Dish Drainers for Kitchen Counter with Drainboard Set Black Dishes Drying Rack Dish Sink Strainers with Removable Utensil Cup Holder-Black-14.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TJKU8pw+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"4 IN 1 DISHES RACKS- TreeLen drying rack kitchen combines a metal plates rack, a drain tray, a silverware holder and a cup holder together. Compact but functional. The dish strainers for kitchen counter has a small footprint about 14.6*11.8*5”, but can hold up to 12 plates, 3 cups, tumblers or wine glasses, 30 silverware or flatware, and some pots and pans-Perfect for 1-2 people daily dish cleaning or an extra drying system besides dishwasher FAST DRAINAGE- Air dry your dishes right on your counter using the TreeLen dish drying rack with drainboard. The open designed wire metal kitchen drying rack lets the air flow freely and drains more effectively than ever. The small dish drying rack rests atop a black plastic drain board, which can catch every drip water. The side opening of the draining board helps to draining directly, continuously and automatically into the sink. NO more water left on your dishes or counter EASY TO CLEAN-The utensil holder and cupholders are removable for an easier hand cleaning or just to go to your dishwasher easily-Hands Free! With a simple drain tray without swivel spout, just lift the dish strainer and clean by water. The removable cutlery holder can also be hung outside the rack, if you need more space for larger pots and pans, temporarily remove the utensil holder RUST FREE AND STRONG FRAME-The dishrack is made of coated wire which can highly reduce the risk of rust. The thicker and heavier frame can support a lot of weight, hold your dinner type dishes and heavy pots better than the thin dish dryer WORRY FREE AFTER SERVICE-We will provide 45 days Money Back Guarantee and 12 Months Warranty. If you have any issue, please contact us, we have a professional team to solve your problem. Purchase our kitchen sink drying rack with worry free!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TJKU8pw+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TreeLen","source_asin":"B08SCGMGMP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200417","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SCGMGMP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SCGMGMP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
