window.products.push({"id":200475,"name":"Adpartner 6PCS Rectangle Silicone Lids for Food Storage, Reusable BPA-free Silicone Stretch Lids in 6 Different Sizes to Fit Most Square and Rectangle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o5hy2Q8oL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Please CHECK THE SIZE details carefully before purchasing, this is very important as it determines the perfection of use! These rectangle silicone lids are better fit for square and rectangular containers. For reference: the largest size is 8.0*5.9 inches(20.5*15 cm), and the smallest size is 2.6*2.0 inches(6.5*5 cm). Easy to Use & Strong Sealing - (Important!) Wipe the lid and container edges to keep them completely dry before use, as moisture will cause the lid slip off. Then stretch the silicone food lid to make it cover on container, the good flexibility can easy to create an air-tight vacuum seal on the container to keep food fresh. (Note: Overstretched also will cause slip-off even tore.) Safety BPA-free Silicone Materials - These silicone stretch lids are made of food-grade silicone material, non-toxic and odorless, harmless and safe to touch with food directly. Heat resistance from 40°F up to 450°F that is safe for use in the fridge, microwave, and dishwasher. Durable & Reusable - These food-grade silicone container lids are super flexible and tear-resistance, durable for stretching repeatedly. They are also easy to clean, you can just rinse them with warm soapy water or throw them in the dishwasher. These rectangle silicone food lids are a perfect complement for the disposable plastic wrap which can help you save a lot! 6 PCS Various Sizes & Multi-useful - These stretchable container covers are super practical, they are ideal for storing leftovers, taking dishes to potluck, stacking bowls, unfinished drinks, leftovers, fruits, and vegetables. Suitable to fit glass, plastic and metal containers. The six dimensions are 2.6*2.0 inches, 3.7*2.7 inches, 4.5*3.0 inches, 5.7*4.3 inches, 6.5*4.7 inches, and 8.0*5.9 inches respectively.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o5hy2Q8oL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adpartner","source_asin":"B08R61RCXJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200475","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R61RCXJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R61RCXJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":200476,"name":"Totally Bamboo NewBoo Black Silicone Scraper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t1Jr2MrNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Black Silicone Scraper has a beautiful and ergonomic NewBoo handle and silicone head. Silicone head will resist temperatures up to 500 degrees Fahrenheit, so you need not worry about using it while cooking stovetop. The handle is constructed of NewBoo, a lovely, distinctive and ecologically responsible material. NewBoo is made entirely from rapidly renewable bamboo, this newly developed material is completely \"tree free\", yet it invokes the warmth and beauty of European olive wood or an exotic tropical hard wood ... all the sophisticated aesthetics yet none of the guilt. Originally developed for use as railroad ties in China, from this humble beginning Totally Bamboo recognized its potential and has refined the manufacturing process to its current form. Utilizing a specially developed system of heating pulverized bamboo fiber, it is then extremely compressed, permanently fusing it together utilizing a food safe, formaldehyde free adhesive to form a void-free block from which Totally Bamboo's NewBoo products are made. Utensil features a convenient eyelet allowing utensil to be hung from a rack or hook.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t1Jr2MrNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Totally Bamboo","source_asin":"B003WJQ2MG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200476","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003WJQ2MG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003WJQ2MG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
