window.products.push({"id":200492,"name":"Crystalia Glass Oil and Vinegar Dispenser Set for Kitchen, Modern Olive Oil and Vinegar Pour Bottle Set, Cruet with Silicone Lid, Small Oil Decanter S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714pB5FnQJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"We want to inspire your kitchens with our quality products at Crystalia.\" FEATURING Premium European Quality Glass Oil Dispenser Set:Crystalia excellent quality glass oil and vinegar dispenser set made with high quality toughened European clear and smooth glass. These excellent small glass bottles are perfect for serving olive oil, vinegar, balsamic vinegar, salad dressing and other healthy oils. Lead-Free Healthy Glass Olive Oil and Vinegar Pour Bottle Set:Healthy lead-free European made glass oil pour set bowl set does not contain harmful elements such as lead and safe for any kind of food. Lead-free glass not only safe for food contact but refracts more light than ordinary glasses, so you can see your food more clearly. Do not compare with Made in China glasses. Drip-Free Glass Drizzler Set for Salad Dressing, Vinegar and Oil:This olive oil and vinegar cruet set with silicone lid is an excellent gift for any occasion. It is also suitable for any kind of dressing. Ships in a beautifully designed printed box. The perfect gift for Christmas, Birthday or Wedding Anniversary. Great for engagement parties, promotion parties, gatherings with friends, or formal dinners Oil and Vinegar Decanter Set with BPA-Free Spill Prof Silicone Lid:With durable BPA free rubber cap, this drizzle set is a perfect addition to your kitchen collection at home or your shop. Comfortable in the hand; no drip or spill thanks to its cap, mess free, leak free. It is dishwasher, refrigerator and freezer safe. Includes:2 Glass Oil and Vinegar Dispenser. Packaging:We believe in our packaging quality! Each product is carefully packaged for trouble-free delivery. If the products you received are defective, please contact us ASAP. We guarantee to offer you a replacement or refund. SPECIFICATIONS Product Diameters: Each botte has Capacity 9.8 OZ (290 cc) and 5 inch (127 mm) height. Material: Glass and BPA-Free Silicone Lid","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714pB5FnQJS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crystalia","source_asin":"B08XY8Z6FY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200492","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XY8Z6FY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XY8Z6FY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":200493,"name":"Extra Large Bath Mat Runner 24\" x 48\" Quick Dry Super Absorbent Bathroom Runner Rug Non Slip Rubber Backed Bath Runner Rug Random Stripes Print Long B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71obx2uTxsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Super Absorbent & Quick Dry Bath Mat】Crafted from premium soft diatomaceous earth,which can absorbs water on the soles of your feet and evaporates instantly to prevent water accumulation on the floor. Dry with your feet up. You will never take away a drop of water with this bath rug runner! 【Non-Slip Rubber Backed Bath Mat】Non slip bath mats for bathroom, made of upgraded and high density rubber sole. This long bath mat has strong adsorption and grip to the ground, not easy to slide. Ideal for shower, sink, single or double vanity, beside your bathtub, and any other high traffic areas. 【Durable & No Shedding Material】This soft diatomaceous earth bath mat is more durable than traditional fiber bathmat. There will no microfiber flying in your home. And this extra large bath rugs will never shedding, fading and no bad smell. Bring you a healthier and easier life environment. 【Modern & Stylish Bathroom Decor】Modern striped bath rug,designed with simple regular symmetrical lines. Add an artistic and contemporary sense for your house. This contemporary style long bathroom mat can easily be harmonious with your any home decoration. 【Easy to Clean】Easy-clean extra long bath mat, which is easy to maintain. You can use a vacuum cleaner clean it if there exist a little dust. Rinse with shower nozlle or just wipe it clean is OK. Do not dry after rinsing, just air dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71obx2uTxsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MontVoo","source_asin":"B09ZDTPSCL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200493","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZDTPSCL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZDTPSCL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
