window.products.push({"id":200564,"name":"Shelby 5-Pc Rustic Wood & Metal Dining Set, Rustic / Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qsTAmpiCL._AC_SL1412_.jpg","description":"Looking for a beautiful dining set that is light and airy? The Dorel Living Shelby 5 Piece Rustic Wood and Metal Dining Set is the answer. With its light rustic wood top, its complementing espresso faux leather seats, and its curved table frame, the Shelby Dining Set is both functional and eye-catching. 4 chairs come with the set, and each feature an elegant backrest cutout detail with a nicely padded seat. The black metal frame of the chairs and table allow this set to blend in seamlessly with your home's decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qsTAmpiCL._AC_SL1412_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dorel Living","source_asin":"B011A2TSK4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B011A2TSK4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B011A2TSK4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":200565,"name":"Hypnotic Gems Materials: 3 lbs Vibrant Tumbled Mix - at Least 30 Different Stone Types in Every Bag - A Spectacular Dyed and Natural Stone Mix for Wic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hcTTcljAL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"This Hypnotic Gems exclusive Vibrant Stone Mix is hand bagged to GUARANTEE you receive a minimum of 30 DIFFERENT STONE TYPES IN EVERY BAG! This is an exotic \"A to \"AAA\" grade vibrant stone mix made in the Hypnotic Gems tumbling factory for those who are looking for premium quality stones with a great energy and superior beauty.Hypnotic Gems also has their our own production line right here in the USA where they hand package every bag by adding at least one piece of each of the following tumbled stones: Amazonite, Aventurine, Banded Amethyst, Bloodstone, Blue Chalcedony, Blue Howlite, Blue Tiger Eye, Botswana Agate, Brecciated Jasper, Dalmation Jasper-Green, Dalmation Jasper-Blue, Dalmation Jasper-Purple, Fancy Jasper, Gold Tiger Eye, Green Moss Agate, Leopardskin Jasper, Moonstone, Petrified Wood, Picture Jasper, Red Jasper, Red Tiger Eye, Rhodonite, Rose Quartz, Sodalite, Snowflake Obsidian, Turitella Agate, Turquenite, Unakite, White Howlite and Yellow Jasper.Once all 30 stone types are in the bag the remainder is filled with additional stones from the above types to give an amazing Vibrant mix equal to the weight ordered. Lastly, a Hypnotic Gems genuine certificate of authenticity is added to every bag which lists all the material types included. While it is time consuming to make each bag by hand, Hypnotic Gems is proud to offer product that is such a high quality and provide this truly extraordinary product to their customers.Please note: As earth mined stones there may still be some imperfections or blemishes visible after being tumbled even when using high graded rough materials. Certain material types will have more imperfections than others due to their natural characteristics and the way they form in nature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hcTTcljAL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hypnotic Gems","source_asin":"B00CJPP84M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CJPP84M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CJPP84M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
