window.products.push({"id":200651,"name":"Hammam Linen Bath Towel Set 3 Pieces Soft and Absorbent, Premium Quality 100% Cotton 1 Bath Towel 1 Hand Towel 1 Washcloth (Cool Grey)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A13kehSHb9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We have been crafting linens for hotels for nearly fifty years. Today, you'll find our products in many of the finest hotels and spas around Europe and the Mediterranean. Boutique gems and major hoteliers trust us to provide exceptional guest experiences for which they're known for. You've been asking how you can get our linens for your own home and we're more than excited to oblige-in fact, we think it's our sole responsibility to do so . And so we've launched Hammam Linen, our exclusive collection of bedroom and bath essentials made for the finest hotels, made in Turkey, and now conveniently available to you. We've been supplying bed & bath linen to many large high end brands for many years and have helped them build their brand by supplying our high-quality products & services. After years of experience, we have decided to sell the same high-quality bed & bath linen to customers directly at a fair price. Our 100% pure ringspun cotton oversized and extra large bath towels are woven on state of the art European luxury towel looms. These bath towels are highly absorbent and will last a long time. Ideal for everyday use, these are highly versatile and can also be used as beach towels. We recommend to launder before first use. Easy to care for, just throw them in your washing machine. They will grow softer and fluffier with each wash. Cotton Turkish towels are often used in spas because of their incredible softness against the skin while also being incredibly absorbent, making Turkish cotton bath towels a comfortable choice for any spa treatment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A13kehSHb9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hammam Linen","source_asin":"B0C5HS1BMF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200651","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5HS1BMF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5HS1BMF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":200652,"name":"Numbrer 17 for 17th Birthday or Anniversary Cake Topper Party Decoration Supplies, Gold, 1.75 Inches Tall","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pCS4ulLuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is a must have bling cake topper for 17th birthday or anniversary party decoration. It will will definitely add glamour to the party and grab everone's attention. This gorgeous cake topper is covered with genuine crystal rhinestones on one side. This metal alloy gold plated number 17 cake topper has the finest quality you can get. This cake topper is ideal for 6-8 inch wide cake. Whether it’s a sheet cake or multi-tiered design, this number cake topper will fit atop any type of dessert. Easily cut the metal prongs to desired size so that the numbers set perfectly on top of your dessert. This can be used as a 17th birthday cake topper, a centerpiece, part of a floral arrangement or place setting. You can remove the metal prong after the party and save this as a keepsake.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pCS4ulLuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Charming Collections","source_asin":"B01MT6CI7Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200652","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MT6CI7Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MT6CI7Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
