window.products.push({"id":200692,"name":"Isaac Jacobs Large 3-Compartment Acrylic Stackable Organizer (12.9\" L x 5\" W x 2.7\" H), Multi-Sectional Tray & Storage Solution for Makeup, Craft Supp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/410v0NaAHxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Isaac Jacobs Large 3-Compartment Clear Acrylic Organizer is an ideal multi-functional storage solution that will help de-clutter any countertop in the home. With its see-through appearance, this stylish tray blends in beautifully with the décor of any bathroom or kitchen. With three sections to choose from, you can fill the compartments with numerous small-to-medium size cosmetics and makeup accessories, as well as office and school supplies. Clean up your vanity counter while keeping your medicine cabinet from overflowing with this efficient organizer. This multi-sectional tray is designed to be stackable to bring order to any counterspace; and it fits neatly in bathroom and kitchen drawers. The multi-purpose organizer is built with high quality Lucite material. The three cube shaped compartments are ideal for storing cosmetics and makeup items like lipstick, lip gloss, blush, makeup wedges, compacts and eyeshadow. Arrange your daily beauty accessories like bobby pins, hair ties, hair clips, lip balm, nail clippers and cotton swabs and rounds. Cut down on the ever-growing mess on your child’s desk. Fill each section with a coin collection. Organize school essentials like crayons, loose paper clips, erasers, small binder clips or sticky note pads in this multi-sectional tray. For the craft lover, this handy, compact acrylic organizer tray will help you tidy up your craft table. Classify items like small tape rolls, buttons, push pins, beads, sequins and glitter in this efficient organizer. This space-saving solution will also come in handy in the kitchen. Use it as a spice-rack substitute, or to clean up your coffee station by displaying sweetener packets, tea bags and coffee pods neatly. You will enjoy how this attractive 3-compartment organizer stores the items you grab every day and keeps them within reach. [Note: Do not use window cleaner on acrylic] [Overall Dimensions: 12.9\" L x 5\" W x 2.7\" H] [Individual Sections: 4.1” L x 4.6” W x 2.6” H]","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/410v0NaAHxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Isaac Jacobs International","source_asin":"B08GMC5HML","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200692","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GMC5HML","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GMC5HML","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
