window.products.push({"id":200726,"name":"Christmas Window Silhouette Lights Decorations, Pack of 3 Lighted Santa Claus Crutch and Xmas Trees Window Silhouette for Holiday Indoor Wall Door Gla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IWY2CxR-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Large window silhouette lights, great for xmas! Wish you happy and a good mood in this coming Christmas holiday. Are you still boring about searching the appropriate decorating Christmas silhouette lights? Don’t worry, the unique 2 pack of snowflake and pentagram lights are the unique one designed for you! Cautions: 1. To reduce the risk of fire, do not deliberately reposition the lights 2. For temporary(90days) installation and use only 3. To reduce the likelihood of excessive heat and possible damage, use only decorative light accessories packaged with this item 4. Always unplug this item before installing or replacing fuses or bulbs 5. To reduce the fire or electric shock, do not install on trees with needles, leaves or branches covering by metals or materials which look like metal 6. Do not hang on with string lights in a manner that can cut or damage wire insulation 7. This item contains 50 bulbs respectively. To reduce the risk of overheating, replace burnt-out bulb or fuse promptly 8. This is an electric item, not toys! To avoid risk of fire, burns, personal injury and electric shock, it should not be played with or placed where children can reach it Features: 1. No smell, no harmful elements, safety first 2. Unique figure or pattern are appealing during night lighting 3. Replacing bad or damaged bulbs and fuses to ensure it run for whole holiday 4. UL certified plug, nice, safe and durable Specifications: Item size: 16” Light color: clear+multicolored Mini bulb quantity: 50 pieces for each silhouette Lead cord length: 24” Cord and plug color: white Working mode: steady on Rated average life: 2000H Packages: 1 x Christmas window silhouette Tree lights 1 x Santa Claus window lights 2 x Spare fuses for each pattern 2 x Spare bulbs for each pattern2 x Suction cup","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IWY2CxR-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Minetom","source_asin":"B0BHSS18TM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200726","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHSS18TM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHSS18TM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":200727,"name":"Precision Kitchenware - Stainless Steel Apple Peeler Corer and Slicer - Luxury Black Edition","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41aeckJefsL._AC_.jpg","description":"Everyone loves apples; they're tasty, they're good for you and you can do so much with them! From pies, crumbles and tarts to mousse, juice and jellies, there are hundreds of ways you can use those delicious little treats. Imagine the whole family come over for a Sunday roast and you cook an amazing dinner; roast belly of pork, Chantilly carrots, amazing fluffy potatoes, red cabbage cooked in balsamic vinegar, with the most incredible apple sauce. Then to top it off, the most delectable apple crumble the world has ever seen! Your family would be so impressed and make you feel so proud. Daydreaming about this really makes you want to do it, doesn't it? Well, you're going to need help, and that's where the Precision Kitchenware Stainless Steel Apple Peeler, Corer and Slicer comes in. Peeling, coring and slicing apples is tedious work, especially when you've got a large party to cook for, and about 50 other jobs to do. Even if you're not cooking for anyone, and just want to eat a couple of apples without the peel on, this apple peeler will do the trick in no time. This product cores, peels and slices apples at the turn of a handle; it's simple and completely safe to use, and easy to clean up. Put the worry of having to slave away in the kitchen for hours behind you, and go ahead and make those fantastic pies, tarts and crumbles that everyone loves! P.S. The Precision Kitchenware Apple Peeler, Corer and Slicer will work for more than just apples, use it with potatoes, pears and just about any other similar shaped fruit or veg!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41aeckJefsL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Precision Kitchenware","source_asin":"B00P6KJ4WE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200727","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00P6KJ4WE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00P6KJ4WE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":200728,"name":"JUSPURBET Farmhouses Pillow Covers with Cotton Linen Tassels Striped,Soft Decorative Throw Cushion Case for Couch Bed Sofa,26x26 Inches,Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xq+aldM6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Both sides are tassels stripes design,Brings farmhouses and modern Look To Your Home Decor, Living Rooms, Bedrooms, Offices, Kitchen, Etc. Material:80% cotton and 20% linen,very soft and environmental.Brand New 2 PCs Square Covers /Shells 26\"x26\", No Filler/Insert. We Use Matching Shade Invisible Zipper Closure For an Elegant Look, Easy Insertion and Washing. Ultra Soft Feel, Brings Warm and Modern Look To Your Home Decor, Living Rooms, Bedrooms, Offices, Kitchen, Etc. WHY CHOOSE US - At JUSPURBET, we fully stand behind our products. If you don't 100% love our products, please don't hesitate to contact us, and we do our best to make sure you are satisfied again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Xq+aldM6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUSPURBET","source_asin":"B083QYM14Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200728","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083QYM14Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083QYM14Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":200729,"name":"The Ethnic Crafts Beige Floral Print Handmade Suzani Kantha Quilt, Indian Traditional Home Decor Kantha Bed-Cover, Queen Size Blanket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YRQvfHmVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton Indian Quilt Kantha Quilted Bedspreads,Throws,Ralli,Gudari Handmade Bedding newly made this is a special hand quilted Kantha. This work is done in countryside that provides work and livelihood for women in COUNTRYSIDE.The entire quilt is painstakingly embroidered with thousands of small and delicate kantha stitches to create a one of a kind masterpiece! It is made from vintage old cotton saris, and softly quilted . It is embroidered by artisans in countryside. Kantha is the ancient Indian art of embroidery, actually the kantha is a simple running stitch. The way in which the stitch has been used is what makes the quilt extraordinary. While making the PIECES, the cloth is given layers that are kept together by the stitches. It is made is such a way that it is REVERSIBLE, can be used from both sides. As this is made from vintage sarees, it has some imperfections. They have patches of other color clothes. they might have some stains, although we wash them well before shipping to remove bad odor and spots. All these imperfections make these vintage art pieces more unique, charming & perfect piece for your home. We hope u would love this art.Note – colour may be little bit change because of the monitor screen setting or may be some camera lights . Washing only in cold water or dry clean","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YRQvfHmVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Ethnic Crafts","source_asin":"B01CI3313E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200729","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CI3313E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CI3313E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":200730,"name":"Caspari Christmas Pop-Up Advent Calendar, Star","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.21,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ef+pUi-FL._AC_SL1333_.jpg","description":"The christmas star advent calendar from caspari is a festive tradition for any family to celebrate the days of december leading up to christmas. This unique 3-dimensional star can hang in any room and features illustrations of the three wiseman. Steeped in 1900 century german lutheran history, advent calendars have always been an active, engaging way to count down the days to christmas for children and adults both. Behind each door is a themed picture. Advent calendars with the story book are also available from caspari. The star is 11-1/2--inch by 11-1/2--inch when open. Celebrate the holidays with caspari.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ef+pUi-FL._AC_SL1333_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caspari","source_asin":"B008B3W54W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200730","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008B3W54W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008B3W54W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
