window.products.push({"id":200758,"name":"CAROMIO Fluffy Area Rugs for Living Room, Soft and Thick Faux Fur Plush Tie Dye Area Rug Indoor Shag Rug Home Decor Nursery Rug Carpets for Bedroom, C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rO5OvcccL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ultra Soft and Smooth Touch: Our shag area rug is ideal for traditional and contemporary rooms as it dampens noise and warms up cold bare floors. Lie on your fuzzy carpet, 4cm high velvet pile gives a super soft feeling to the touch. A dense sponge layer in the middle that provides high-level coziness, soothe tired muscles. It's like lying on a cloud, bring you to fall into wonderful dreams easily. Higher-density Faux Fur: Feature 1.57\" pile, 400 GSM High-density shag carpet surface(total about 650GSM with bottom), our area rug is incredibly soft and comfortable. No more shedding carpet fibers! Our shaggy area rug is richly colored and an ideal choice for home decoration. It's perfect for the living room, bedroom, nursery, children's room, girl's room, baby's room, playroom, kindergarten, or your new space for homeschooling. Safe Materials: Our area rug was designed to last for years to come! This extremely soft fluffy velvet carpet is made from safe polyester material. You could feel free to lay on it, barefoot walking, and good for tummy time. Environmentally friendly high pile adds a touch of luxury, no odor, not easy to fade and not easily contaminated by dust. Anti-Slip Bottom: Thousands of non slip grip dots at the bottom of the rug, these anti-slip grips are effective at preventing the rug from sliding on the floor, for children playing on the floor is a great choice, it can give them warmer and more comfy feeling. Easy Clean: We recommend to vacuum the rug regularly to reduce potential sheds and dust, or you can hand wash the dirty area without worrying about color fade. Do not use bleach. In order to make transportation convenient, our carpet packaging is well folded and compressed, so when you unpack the package, it will be a little thinner than the original thickness, and it will not so flat on the floor, but it will return to normal after 3-5 days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rO5OvcccL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAROMIO","source_asin":"B0968GKJJX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0968GKJJX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0968GKJJX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
