window.products.push({"id":200767,"name":"Houwsbaby Plush Elf Legs for Christmas Tree Decor Stuffed Legs Stuck in Tree for Home Party Fireplace Ornaments, Red, 20''","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91E9udc7roL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE ORIGIN OF THE CHRISTMAS ELF --- The Christmas elf is a diminutive elf that lives with Santa Claus at the North Pole and acts as his helper. Christmas elves are often depicted as green or red clad with large, pointy ears and pointy hats. The elves of Santa are often said to make the toys in the workshop of Santa and take care of his reindeer, among other tasks. FEATURES --- The Christmas decorations are red, white and green, classic colors of Christmas. The plush elf decors can perfectly match with other Christmas decorations in your house, adding more holiday atmosphere. Simply place the legs decorations into your Christmas tree to make them look as if the elf is stuck, that's very interesting! MATERIALS --- The Christmas decoration is made of high quality cotton cloth and felt cloth, the fine stitching makes the decoration strong and durable, you can reuse Christmas decorations. Filled with pp cotton makes the Christmas elf decoration soft and easy to store. There is iron wire inside the decoration, you can put the legs of elf into the shape you want according to your needs. PERFECT FOR CHRISTMAS PARTIES --- It has become a tradition to hold parties to celebrate Christmas every year. The elf Christmas Tree Legs Decorations provide a strong ambience of the Christmas, and give you an unforgettable and happy Christmas. Please enjoy yourselves with this legs decoration at the wonderful Christmas party. A VARIETY OF CHRISTMAS DECORATIONS AVAILABLE --- Besides the elf Christmas tree legs decorations, we also have themed Christmas stockings, skirts and other ornaments for Christmas tree to go with. Moreover, we also provide rustic, vintage, 3D, DIY, and many other creative styles of decorations, welcome to our store and find the one you were looking for. Please don't hesitate to contact us if you have any problems, either before purchasing or after sale. We would reply in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91E9udc7roL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Houwsbaby","source_asin":"B08FRD3HZ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200767","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FRD3HZ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FRD3HZ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
