window.products.push({"id":200879,"name":"Panda Grip Mattress Protector Waterproof Mattress Cover Ultra Soft Breathable & Noiseless Cotton Terry Matressprotector (a-Twin)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qbLk+fPbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ 100% Impervious to Liquids of All Kinds: Everyone experiences unexpected \"accidents\" or spills in bed, so protecting your precious mattress is a must! Now, it’s easy with our 100% waterproof mattress protector. Specially designed TPU membrane effectively prevents all liquids from leaking, including perspiration, urine, and body fluids of all kinds. Great for kids, pets, incontinence care, etc. ❤ Ultra-Soft & Noiseless: Premium Fitted Cotton Terry Cover surface is softer and more comfortable than ordinary fabric protectors, making it soft enough to use even on its own. and molds to, the contour of your mattress, making your bed the perfect place for a comfortable and healthy sleeping environment. Our mattress cover will not change the feel of your mattress. You can rest assured, knowing that there will be no crinkling sound or plasticky feel to disrupt your valuable sleep. ❤ Easy to Clean & Durable: Instead of throwing away your entire mattress, you can easily protect and extend its life with a premium quality bed mattress protector. After an accident, simply throw the contaminated mattress protector into the washing machine. （Note: Tumble dry on low. Do not bleach. Do not dry clean）For frequent accidents, we suggest buying two or more mattress protectors to always have another on hand while one is in the wash. ❤ Ultimate Protection: Our mattress cover is designed to keep your mattress clean and protect you your health and the integrity of your sleeping environment. Our premium matressprotector is soft, great for those with kids, pets, or incontinence issues. ❤ Fitted Sheet Style: 360°anti-skid fully-surrounded elastic band ensures the mattress protector stays in place, and never slip or bunch up like others. Matressprotector are available in 4 different sizes Fitted 14\" - 18\" Deep Pocket . We provide 30-day Return/Replacement Service.If you are not satisfied for any reason, Pls contact our Customer Support and we will do everything to make you satisfied.so you can purchase worry-free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qbLk+fPbS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panda Grip","source_asin":"B0865SM3CC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200879","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0865SM3CC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0865SM3CC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
