window.products.push({"id":200962,"name":"Flixeno Large Sturdy Red Round Cake Carrier Holder Up to 10 inch Multi Purpose Cover Five Section Keeper for Easily Hold & Transport Cakes Pies & Cupc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gk+9dCAIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔴 LARGE Capacity - Our modern tray is specifically designed to accommodate most of large cakes, it features a spacious interior that can hold a cake with ease, while also providing ample room for frosting, decorations, and other toppings. Easily Fits 10 Inch, Make Sure Your Cake Has Up To 4 1/2 inch High. Total Size of Carrier Is 11.8 Inch diameter & 6 Inch Tall. If you're looking for a reliable and spacious container that can easily fit your bake - You've come to the right place! 🔴 STURDY LATCHES - No more worrying about your cakes! One of the best features is a sturdy construction with an easy-to-use locking system with 3 latches & 3 additional that provide a secure closure, preventing any accidental falls, spills or messes. 🔴 MULTI PURPOSE BASE - Our multiple base is designed with a convenient 5-section no-slip bottom base which can be used not just for cakes, but for variety of foods like nuts, fruits, and other non-baked goods. In addition to nuts and fruits, a cake stand can also be used to display and serve other types of food, such as appetizers, cheeses, and desserts. And all with an attractive and organized way, just flip the bottom and enjoy 🔴 CLEAR LID - This clear lid is an important feature as it allows for easy viewing of the cake inside without having to remove the lid, this particularly useful if you are transporting the cake to a party or event and want to ensure that it remains intact and visually appealing, that lets you show off your best baked goods while protecting and it also helps to keep the cake fresh by creating an airtight seal that prevents air from getting in and drying out the cake. 🔴 Bake, Store and Transport with Ease! Meet our cake holder that comes with secure collapsible handles that is designed to provide a reliable and sturdy storage solution for your cakes while also being easy to carry with you on the go. It is made of high-quality PP plastic material that ensure its longevity and resistance to wear and tear as well as protect it from external factors like temperature and moisture. 🔴 Don't face any difficulty in transporting your cakes and pies ADD TO CART our cake carrier with lid and handle at an affordable price and transform your bakery today","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Gk+9dCAIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flixeno","source_asin":"B0BTB3LVVQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTB3LVVQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTB3LVVQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
