window.products.push({"id":200979,"name":"CXhome Heat Powered Stove Fan, 140°F/60°C Fast Start 4-Blade Wood Stove Fan, Eco Friendly Ultra Quiet Circulating Warm Air Saving Fuel Fireplace Fan f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X6NwiEJOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☀【ENERGY SAVING AND ENVIRONMENTAL PROTECTION】 Fan for stove works without batteries, ropes or electricity. When the wood stove is heated, the base of the fan transfers heat to the power generation module, which converts the heat energy into electric energy and drives the motor&blades to rotate, and the heating flow is delivered to the Indoor. Use CXhome stove fan can save 30% wood consumption and reduce carbon emission, energy conservation and environmental protection. ☀ 【UPGRADE 4 BLADES FOR BETTER RESULTS】Upgrade 4 blades and dispense warm air throughout the room. Simply place the stove fan on a flat, smooth surface on the top of your stove, near the side or back of the stovepipe. This will work when the stove surface is hot. Airflow coverage：180-210CFM ☀ 【QUICK START】High performance power generation module and motor imported from Japan are adopted. The fan rotates when the temperature reaches 40°C/104°, it can start quickly, 40% faster than the old models on the market. The warmer the base of the fan, the faster the fan rotates . It will slow down and stop while the stove is cooling down. Operating temperature: 40°C -350°C (104°F-662°F) ☀ 【OVERHEAT PROTECTION DEVICE】 The fan assembly is made of anodised aluminum, which will not rust and corrode if the fan overheats, sturdy and durable. A bimetallic safety device is installed at the base of the fan. If the surface temperature exceeds 300°C/573°F, the safety device gently raises the front of the fan to reduce the contact surface between the fan and the wood stove, reduce the temperature and protect the motor. ☀ 【QUIET WORK】Quiet work, no more airflow noise. Features with the unique design of the blade, the stove fan can drive more warm air with quiet operation. No noise. You will enjoy the warm air in a calm and comfortable environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X6NwiEJOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CXhome","source_asin":"B08HCP247T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200979","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HCP247T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HCP247T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":200980,"name":"Acalu Ice Cube Tray, 26-Ice Trays with Box and Lid, Silicone Ice Pop Molds Ice Storage Box Container for Freezer, Cocktail Whiskey Orange","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tl6FoJQAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄【Food-grade Safety Material】Made of silicone and PP material which are certified by LFGB, Acalu ice trays sets safe and durable. The ice tray can make 26 ice cubes, and can be stored in the included 64 oz ice bucket. Bring customers the perfect cocktail and ice coffee experience at home. Silicone ice cube tray kits great for home use, parties, whisky and bars etc. ❄【Easy Ice Removal】 Silicone ice cube trays with lid use TPE material shapes the bottom well, which makes it easy to release ice cubes and the soft silicone material will not break after freezing for a long time. Each flat cube compartment is separate from others so you can easily push from the bottom. No need for awkward bending or twisting. ❄【Transparent Lid Design】This smart tool allows you to make nice cubes while preventing spills and the freezing of excess water and keeps ice cubes from absorbing freezer odors So add a transparent lid. Moreover, these easy-release trays stack easily and neatly in the freezer without sticking. ❄【Easy to Use & Dishwasher Safe】 Fill the trays with water, cover the lid on, and then slip the trays into the freezer. Besides water, you can fill the ice cube trays silicone with fruits, ice cream, soda and wine to customize your favorite flavor. Can be taken out with the included ice shovel when taking it. And you can simply put them into your dishwasher after use. ❄【Acalu provide customers with great products and services】If you are not satisfied with our ice cube tray and ice bucket, please return it to Amazon within 30 days and we will give a full .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tl6FoJQAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Acalu","source_asin":"B09WRVZTD2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-200980","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WRVZTD2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WRVZTD2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
